13200	13200	13184	13184	She	128	”
13201	13263	13269	13269	he	704	“ I should have been sorry , Mr. Knightley , to be dependent on _ your _ recommendation , had I quitted Mr. Woodhouse ’s family and wanted another situation ; I do not think you would have spoken a good word for me to any body . I am sure you always thought me unfit for the office I held . ”
13264	13267	13269	13269	he	704	“ Yes , ”
